% Master bibliography of the TRexSelector library
% ============================================================
% Conventions (IEEE reference style via biblatex-ieee):
%   - Titles of articles, proceedings papers and online sources are written as published, in single
%     braces:
%     biblatex-ieee converts them to sentence case itself. Protect proper nouns and acronyms with
%     inner braces,
%     e.g. {FDR}, {T-Rex}, {PCA}. Double braces {{...}} would switch that conversion off.
%   - Book titles stay in title case.
%   - Journal and proceedings names are abbreviated as in IEEE reference lists.
%   - Article numbers go into eid, DOIs into doi.
%   - Every field of an entry with a local PDF was read from that PDF. Entries without a local PDF
%     are skeletons plus a TODO note. A field that neither the PDF nor the plan shows is left out.


